   "en": "My husband is very \"gentle.\" He's\nbig, positive, messy, and exquisitely naive.\nAnd he's also incredibly kind.\nHis personality is the complete opposite of mine, who is impatient and talkative, but\nlife with my \"gentle husband\" is fun and easygoing every day!\n\nTwitter manga from author Kizaki Aoko about her daily life with her husband"
